WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.997
Stephen King split brand appeal in two.

00:00:03.047 --> 00:00:05.309
Motivators are category must-haves.

00:00:05.359 --> 00:00:07.573
Discriminators set one brand apart.

00:00:07.623 --> 00:00:11.314
Both draw on the senses, reason and emotions.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.217
In the laundry aisle, every detergent gets clothes clean.

00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:16.691
That's a motivator.

00:00:16.741 --> 00:00:19.598
Without it, you're not even on the list.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:23.422
But one smells of fresh linen and has a friendly mascot.

00:00:23.472 --> 00:00:27.226
That discriminator wins her over, with no price war.

00:00:27.933 --> 00:00:28.733
So meet the motivators,

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.784
then build a discriminator,

00:00:30.834 --> 00:00:32.046
ideally emotional,

00:00:32.096 --> 00:00:35.043
so you never compete on price alone.
